{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Secure AI ChatOps.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Secure AI ChatOps.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"secure ai chat ops secure ai chat ops","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Secure AI ChatOps.md","fileName":"Secure AI ChatOps.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Secure AI ChatOps","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Pipeline Engineering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Pipeline Engineering","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Secure AI ChatOps.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Secure AI ChatOps.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"secure ai chat ops secure ai chat ops","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Secure AI ChatOps.md","fileName":"Secure AI ChatOps.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Secure AI ChatOps","heading":"Secure AI ChatOps","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Secure AI ChatOps lets a narrowly scoped comment trigger analysis without turning natural language into unrestricted execution. A workflow verifies that the event belongs to a pull request and contains the bot mention, extracts bounded metadata, invokes a versioned prompt, and posts a constrained response.\n\nThe prompt treats pull-request text as untrusted, forbids secrets and deployment commands, and requires a predictable format. Read and comment permissions are separated from model credentials, and the bot remains advisory. The conversational surface improves access to analysis while the workflow retains authority over context, tools, and side effects.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Pipeline Engineering","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Secure AI ChatOps.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full No